{
  "type": "screen",
  "title": "Shop app · Tab navigation",
  "desc": "A tab bar lets the user jump between any two tabs. Drawing every pair would need 12 arrows, so the bar is drawn once as a bus: one line into all four tabs. Each tab then has its own stack of screens. Screens that hide the bar sit outside the blue zone.",
